OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,6,Fpossible on Monday, especially in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Most areas will have a fine
OL,8,Fday though with variable cloud and
OL,9,Fbright spells. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,12,Fclear spells, however thicker cloud
OL,13,Facross parts of Country Durham and
OL,14,FNorthumberland will give some
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain later in the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloudy for much of the day on
OL,18,FTuesday with outbreaks of rain and
OL,19,Fdrizzle, the heaviest of which will be
OL,20,Facross the north of the region.
OL,21,FTemperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
