OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FThough
OL,6,Fthe odd shower or outbreak of rain is
OL,7,Fpossible during the period, most
OL,8,Fplaces should hold onto fine weather.
OL,9,FTemperatures will increase slightly,
OL,10,Ffeeling very warm in lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
